  "_comment": "Snapshot of the Tokens Studio -> Figma Variables export (template token project). In a real project this is the figma-variables.json the Tokens Studio export produces; refresh on token-set changes. The coverage test checks every component token resolves to one of these (separator-stripped match). KNOWN GAP: hand-maintained, so it can go stale when new token tiers land (for example the semantic typography/{display,headline}/{sm,xs} tiers). A stale fixture fails the coverage gate. No build input reads this file: the contract build spells variable names from the DTCG, and the Figma plugin decides which variables exist at runtime against the open file. It is a fixture of this skill's coverage test only. Deliberately NOT listed: shadow/* (exported as Figma EFFECT styles, not variables -- the gate buckets them separately) and transition/* (duration/easing are not exported as variables; the gate's NA rule already excludes them).",
